      "_key": "bch0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scgz",
          "text": "Failures to properly maintain buildings and properties can come in various forms. Some of the most common examples involve failures to repair and/or remove:",
